    "text": "Skip to content\n\n  \n    \n    HomeMarketsProductsApplicationsDocumentsResourcesAbout\n    Request a Quote\n  \n  \n    \n    RFQ\n    Menu\n  \n\n\n  \n    \n    RFQ\n    Close\n  \n  HomeMarketsProductsApplicationsDocumentsResourcesAboutRequest a Quote\n\n\n\n\n\nFOR INTERNATIONAL INDUSTRIAL BUYERS\nMalaysia Titanium Dioxide for Industrial Buyers\nFor international industrial buyers sourcing titanium dioxide from Malaysia, explore product grades, destination markets, applications, procurement documents and quotation requirements from one clear starting point.\nRequest a QuoteView Products\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTART HERESelect a starting point based on your market, product or documentation needs.\n\n01MarketsDestination markets→\n02ProductsFourteen grades→\n03DocumentsGuidance and requests→\n\n\n\n\n\nMARKETSStart with your destination marketSelect your destination market to review relevant sourcing, product and documentation considerations.View All Markets →\n\nEUEuropean UnionReview product, sourcing and documentation considerations for the European Union market.European Union market →\nUKUnited KingdomReview product, sourcing and documentation considerations for the United Kingdom market.United Kingdom market →\nINIndiaReview product, sourcing and quotation considerations for the India market.India market →\nBRBrazilReview product, sourcing and documentation considerations for the Brazil market.Brazil market →\n\n\n\n\n\nPRODUCTSFour product groups. Fourteen grades.Compare grades by product group and intended use, then continue to the relevant product page for detailed information.14GRADES ACROSS FOUR PRODUCT GROUPS\n\nCoatings Grades−Grades grouped for coatings applications and product selection.M-350M-510M-896M-996M-2196M-895\nPlastics & Masterbatch Grades−Grades for plastics processing and masterbatch applications.M-200M-108M-210M-340M-886\nInks & Multi-Application−Grades for printing inks and selected multi-application uses.M-52M-2377\nSpecialty Grade−A specialty grade for selected product and application requirements.CR-901\n\nChloride Process →Sulfate Process →View All 14 Grades\n\n\n\n\nAPPLICATIONSExplore by use caseChoose the application that best matches your product, formulation or processing requirements.\n\nCCoatingsReview titanium dioxide for coatings and the key criteria used to compare suitable grades.Coatings information →\nPPlasticsReview titanium dioxide for plastics processing and the factors used to compare suitable grades.Plastics information →\nMMasterbatchReview titanium dioxide for masterbatch production and relevant grade-selection factors. This refers to TiO₂ input, not finished masterbatch supply.Masterbatch information →\nIPrinting InksReview titanium dioxide for printing ink applications and related product options.Printing inks information →\nPPaperReview titanium dioxide for paper applications and relevant product information.Paper information →\n\n\n\n\n\nCOMPANY & SUPPLYKnow the company behind TiO₂ MalaysiaTiO₂ Malaysia is operated by IKHLAS TITANIUM (MALAYSIA) SDN. BHD., a titanium dioxide manufacturer. Visit the About section for company details, supply information, and available information on origin and documentation.About TiO₂ Malaysia →\nIKHLAS TITANIUM (MALAYSIA) SDN. BHD.Supply overviewUnderstand the product, market and procurement scope.Company informationReview the operating entity and company details.Origin & documentationReview available information on origin and related documentation.\n\n\n\nDOCUMENTSAccess product and procurement documentationUse the Documents Hub to review document types and guidance, or submit a request when documentation is needed for a specific product or purchasing requirement.\nDDocuments HubReview guidance on product, sourcing and compliance documentation.View Document Information →RRequest DocumentsRequest documentation for a specific product, application or purchasing requirement.Request Documents →\n\n\n\nRESOURCES & BUYER ANSWERSTechnical and sourcing topics for purchasing teamsUse the short answers below for initial guidance, then open the relevant resource for detailed context and supporting evidence.\n\nAlternative-origin sourcing considerationsReview the factors buyers may need to assess when comparing sourcing origins, including trade measures and documentation requirements.Read sourcing considerations →\nChloride and sulfate process overviewUnderstand chloride and sulfate process terminology before comparing relevant titanium dioxide grades.Read process overview →\nWhere should buyers start?Start with the destination market, then narrow the search by application or product group and confirm the documentation needed for purchasing.Market information →\nHow are the products organised?Fourteen grades are organised into four product groups: coatings, plastics & masterbatch, inks & multi-application, and specialty grades.View all 14 grades →\nHow can a quotation request be prepared?Include the destination market, application, preferred grade if known, quantity, packaging requirements and required documents.Request a Quote →\n\n\n\n\nREQUEST A QUOTEPrepare a structured quotation requestProvide the key purchasing details needed to structure your quotation request.Destination MarketApplicationGrade / ProductQuantityPackagingDocument NeedsRequest a Quote\n\n\n\n  \n    Titanium dioxide product, market and procurement information for international industrial buyers.\n        Explore\n      HomeMarketsProductsApplications        Information\n      DocumentsResourcesAbout        Procurement\n      Request a Quote      \n  \n    Privacy PolicyDasar Privasi (BM)Cookie Policy    Cookie Settings\n  \n  © 2026 TiO2 Malaysia.\n\n\n  Cookie settings\n  No optional Analytics or advertising technology is currently active on this site. Necessary functions may use browser storage to operate the site and remember an available privacy setting.\n  CloseRead Cookie Policy\n\n\n{\"prefetch\":[{\"source\":\"document\",\"where\":{\"and\":[{\"href_matches\":\"/*\"},{\"not\":{\"href_matches\":[\"/wp-*.php\",\"/wp-admin/*\",\"/wp-content/uploads/*\",\"/wp-content/*\",\"/wp-content/plugins/*\",\"/wp-content/themes/tio2-malaysia/*\",\"/*\\\\?(.+)\"]}},{\"not\":{\"selector_matches\":\"a[rel~=\\\"nofollow\\\"]\"}},{\"not\":{\"selector_matches\":\".no-prefetch, .no-prefetch a\"}}]},\"eagerness\":\"conservative\"}]}"
